      "text": "Meeting: TechFest 2026 — Core Committee Sync Date: August 15, 2026 Attendees: Rhea (Fest Coordinator), Aditya (Logistics), Sana (Sponsorship), Farhan (Tech/Web), Ishaan (Design) Rhea: Let's start with venue booking. Aditya, did the auditorium get confirmed for the main day? Aditya: Yes, the main auditorium is confirmed for October 4th. I signed the booking form yesterday. Still pending is the outdoor ground for the gaming zone — the sports office hasn't responded yet. Rhea: Can you follow up with them by this Thursday? Aditya: Sure, I'll chase the sports office by Thursday, August 20th. Rhea: Sponsorship update, Sana? Sana: TechNova Solutions confirmed as title sponsor, contract signed. They're giving 2 lakhs plus swag for participants. On the second sponsor, CodeCraft, they're still reviewing internally — no word yet on amount or timeline. Rhea: Okay, keep nudging them but no fixed deadline since it's out of our hands. Can you at least send the sponsorship deck to two more potential backup sponsors this week? Sana: Yes, I'll send the deck to two backup sponsors by Friday, August 21st. Rhea: Website and registration, Farhan? Farhan: Registration form is live, we've had about 300 signups so far. The payment gateway for the paid workshops is still not integrated — I was waiting on Sana to confirm final workshop pricing before wiring that up. Sana: Right, sorry, I still need to finalize pricing with the workshop leads. I don't have a date for that yet, it depends on their material costs. Rhea: Okay, Farhan, once pricing comes in can you turn around the payment integration in two days? Farhan: Yeah, two days once I get the numbers, so it's blocked on Sana for now. Rhea: Separately, Farhan, can you fix the mobile view of the schedule page? A few people complained it's unreadable on phones.",
